{"version":1,"content":"<p>女子組合Cookies前成員傅穎（現名傅寶誼）與天后楊千嬅，千禧年代曾同屬「金牌娛樂」旗下。</p><p>近日傅穎在訪談節目中罕有重提陳年心結，自爆當年曾獲偶像千嬅暗中向高層力薦出碟，惜最終疑因公司內部的惡意謠言而令兩人漸行漸遠。</p><p>楊千嬅昨日出席活動昤首度</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.570539+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.459857+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:19.459857+00:00","content_hash":"03487de61237eec5eb8edda7061f5146d554e96be848db54330cd408a4a20a24","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}